ight and internal scrolling. The next major task is to clear the form after submission. I'm also implementing a duplicate process check in the backend for `start_process`, verifying completed or reviewing processes with the same files. Finally, I'm refactoring the `submitProcess()` method to eliminate jumps to results.\n\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"type d:\\\\AI_Engineer\\\\Pharmacy-agy\\\\desktop_app\\\\templates\\\\index.html | findstr -n -A 20 \\\"function submitProcess\\\"\"","Cwd":"\"d:\\\\AI_Engineer\\\\Pharmacy-agy\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"500","toolAction":"\"Check submitProcess in index.html\"","toolSummary":"\"Check submitProcess\""}}]}
